  "description": "Store-neutral action audit core for Webority products: ActionAuditEntry, IActionAuditWriter, the query and retention contracts, the actor accessor seam with the system actor for job hosts, and the snapshot diff with identifier masking (by field name, and PAN, GSTIN and Aadhaar numbers inside free text). No ASP.NET dependency, so a worker can reference it alone. Pair it with a store package, and with Webority.Audit.AspNetCore on a web head.",
